---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Header from '../../components/Header.astro';
import Footer from '../../components/Footer.astro';
import CTASection from '../../components/CTASection.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Landscape Design in Little Rock, AR | The Good Earth Garden Center"
  description="Landscape design and build services in Little Rock from The Good Earth Garden Center, focused on functional and beautiful outdoor spaces."
  path="/services/landscape-design-little-rock/"
>
  <Header />
  <main class="mx-auto max-w-5xl px-4 py-16 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    <h1 class="font-serif text-4xl text-olive-900 sm:text-5xl">Landscape Design in Little Rock</h1>
    <p class="mt-4 text-olive-800">The Good Earth describes landscape as an extension of your home and emphasizes design plans tailored to each property and family.</p>
    <p class="mt-4 text-olive-800">Their design and installation process includes understanding your goals, planning around function and aesthetics, and executing the project with experienced installation teams.</p>
    <p class="mt-4 text-olive-800">Related landscape options on the original site include planting plans, lawn and irrigation, landscape lighting, hardscape and outdoor rooms, water features, and maintenance services.</p>
  </main>
  <CTASection title="Start a Landscape Design Plan" text="Connect with The Good Earth to discuss design direction and installation options for your property." primary={{ label: 'Request a Consultation', href: '/contact/' }} />
  <Footer />
</Layout>
